      "answer": "$a=3.33\\,\\mathrm{m\\,s^{-2}}$, with the $10\\,\\mathrm{kg}$ particle moving down and the $5\\,\\mathrm{kg}$ particle up the slope; $T=66.7\\,\\mathrm{N}$.",
